#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/sharpen.rst:14
msgid "Sharpen"
msgstr "Zaostrenie"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/sharpen.rst:18
msgid ""
"Replaced by :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/"
"sharp_unsharp`"
msgstr ""
"Nahradené :doc:`/effects_and_filters/video_effects/blur_and_sharpen/"
"sharp_unsharp`"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/sharpen.rst:22
msgid ""
"The sharpen tool is a port of `unsharp mask <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Unsharp_masking>`_ from Mplayer. The parameters are the usual ones for "
"unsharp masking. The \"size\" means the size of the blur, and the amount is "
"how much of the blurred version gets subtracted."
msgstr ""
"Nástroj zaostrenia je port `neostrého maskovania <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Unsharp_masking>`_ z Mplayera. Parametre sú bežné pre neostré "
"maskovanie. \"Veľkosť\" znamená veľkosť rozmazania a množstvo je to, koľko z "
"rozmazanej verzie sa odčíta."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/sharpen.rst:24
msgid ""
"The Size parameter ranges from 0 to 1000, where 0 represents a 3x3 "
"neighbourhood, 250 represents a 5x5 neighbourhood, and 1000 represents an "
"11x11 neighbourhood. Typically values from 0-250 are a good starting point."
msgstr ""
"Parameter Veľkosť sa pohybuje od 0 do 1000, kde 0 predstavuje okolie 3x3, "
"250 predstavuje okolie 5x5 a 1000 predstavuje okolie 11x11. Zvyčajne sú "
"hodnoty od 0-250 dobrým východiskovým bodom."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/deprecated/sharpen.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Amount parameter also ranged from 0 to 1000, and defaults to an input "
"value of 300. The default value of 300 represents a neutral input, "
"corresponding to a 0% sharpening. Increasing above 300 will increase the "
"sharpening amount, with 500 representing 100% sharpening, 700 representing "
"200% sharpening, and 1000 representing 350% sharpening. A value of 500 (ie. "
"100% sharpening) is typically a good place to start. Reducing the input to "
"below 300 will result in a gaussian blurring of the picture, with an input "
"value of 0 representing a -150% \"sharpening\" (ie. gaussian blurring)."
msgstr ""
"Parameter Množstvo sa tiež pohybuje od 0 do 1000 a predvolene má vstupnú "
"hodnotu 300. Predvolená hodnota 300 predstavuje neutrálny vstup, "
"zodpovedajúci 0% zaostreniu. Zvýšenie nad 300 zvýši mieru zaostrenia, pričom "
"500 predstavuje 100% zaostrenie, 700 predstavuje 200% zaostrenie a 1000 "
"predstavuje 350% zaostrenie. Hodnota 500 (t.j. 100% zaostrenie) je zvyčajne "
"dobrým východiskovým bodom. Zníženie vstupu pod 300 bude mať za následok "
"gaussovské rozmazanie obrázka, pričom vstupná hodnota 0 predstavuje -150% "
"\"zaostrenie\" (t.j. gaussovské rozmazanie)."

